        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a torn country, a soldier faces adversity. <br><br>Armed with his determination and his finger, he accumulates &quot;Roopies,&quot; the currency of courage,<br> to rebuild, upgrade his equipment, and rally his allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every click is an action, every move is a step toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Numerous strategies await you, multiple mathematical and logical systems allowing for numerous approaches. The battlefield takes shape in real time. Will you survive? <br><br>Manual: (QWERTY Keyboard) <br>- &quot;Z Q S D&quot; to move the camera <br>- &quot;Space&quot; to recenter <br>- Left-click on the main circle (the battlefield) to generate Roopies and initiate the purchase of the first unit. <br>- These units then generate passive income. <br>- The blue bar symbolizes your current &quot;level,&quot; each level producing an event. <br>- The yellow bar represents your morale. If it drops to zero, the party is over. To increase it, create tributes on the bottom screen. Your high score will remain displayed on the right screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Good luck, Commander O7.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In a torn country, a soldier faces adversity. <br><br>Armed with his determination and his finger, he accumulates &quot;Roopies,&quot; the currency of courage,<br> to rebuild, upgrade his equipment, and rally his allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every click is an action, every move is a step toward freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Numerous strategies await you, multiple mathematical and logical systems allowing for numerous approaches. The battlefield takes shape in real time. Will you survive? <br><br>Manual: (QWERTY Keyboard) <br>- &quot;Z Q S D&quot; to move the camera <br>- &quot;Space&quot; to recenter <br>- Left-click on the main circle (the battlefield) to generate Roopies and initiate the purchase of the first unit. <br>- These units then generate passive income. <br>- The blue bar symbolizes your current &quot;level,&quot; each level producing an event. <br>- The yellow bar represents your morale. If it drops to zero, the party is over. To increase it, create tributes on the bottom screen. Your high score will remain displayed on the right screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Good luck, Commander O7.</p>",
